<title>INDIA: India 91-day t-bill cut-off steady at 97.57 rupees.</title>
<headline>India 91-day t-bill cut-off steady at 97.57 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off price of 97.57 rupees at the weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills, unchanged from the previous week.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 9.99 percent.</p>
